WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:07.400
There is a real danger of losing
our tenure on this planet altogether.

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.840
We've got to care about
this matter of global warming

00:00:25.160 --> 00:00:28.520
because if we don't
do anything about it

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:30.440
there won't be anybody here.

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:42.400
During my lifetime the big change
that's happened to the world

00:00:42.480 --> 00:00:47.000
has been the development of machines
and devices and inventions.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:48.960
It's about time we went back

00:00:49.040 --> 00:00:51.880
to taking an interest
in the environment.

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:04.160
The Earth has an
impossible atmosphere.

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:06.840
For it to have happened by accident,

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:13.080
the odds against it run into
countless billions-to-one against.

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.840
So something's going on.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:25.920
I tend to think of the Earth
as alive in a sense

00:01:26.840 --> 00:01:31.000
like an animal or a plant
or any other living thing.

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:32.680
Gaia looks after us.

00:01:38.360 --> 00:01:39.800
What happens to the planet

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:43.520
when more carbon dioxide
is put in the air?

00:01:45.040 --> 00:01:46.640
The Earth will get hotter.

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.120
It will heat up to a point

00:01:49.200 --> 00:01:53.520
where no life on it
of our kind will be possible.

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:59.520
Take an interest
in the natural world,

00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:02.920
in plants and animals
and things that grow naturally.

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.440
Not worry too much
at all about schooling.

00:02:06.520 --> 00:02:12.000
The three R's yes, they're very
important, but all the other stuff

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:14.920
I think could be ditched in favour

00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:17.760
of a better understanding
of the world.

00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.560
There are answers of various kinds

00:02:20.640 --> 00:02:24.680
but I think it needs
the right sort of politics

00:02:24.760 --> 00:02:27.640
to change people's thinking
about these things

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:31.600
and I'd like to see these
youngsters using their energies

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:33.840
and their talent in this way

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.760
rather than looking
for some techy answer

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:41.160
because I don't think the
answer's going to come that way.

00:02:41.240 --> 00:02:45.920
I think we have all the things
needed to stop global warming

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.160
we're just not using them.

